          <li><span class="li-num">04</span><span>ACTIMO Setup software supports full single-axis controller setup</span></li>
          <li><span class="li-num">05</span><span>Multiple StepSERVO and BLDCservo drives can be connected simultaneously</span></li>
          <li><span class="li-num">06</span><span>Up to 16 axes can be connected via RS-485 communication</span></li>
          <li><span class="li-num">07</span><span>Control variables (parameters, Action Table, tuning values) are managed as files</span></li>
